// Straight burst-damage GroundAoe, same shape as dark_star.ron. Sheet also
// lists a secondary "muddled-mind" penalty (attacks/checks/concentration)
// on top of the burst -- dropped, same as GroundAoe's own doc comment
// forces elsewhere in this pass (`pooled_debuff` replaces the normal
// damage hit entirely, so a real burst and an attached debuff can't
// coexist on one cast; the burst is the spell's stated primary effect
// here, unlike regal_presence.ron next door where the hold was primary).
//
// Reviewer correction: original 95 energy / 46 damage sat barely above L3
// fireball.ron (90 energy / 48 damage) despite this being L5, well under
// the L3->L9 raw-damage-nuke curve those two endpoints establish
// (fireball.ron L3 -> axiomancy/dark_star.ron L9: 225 energy / 80 damage).
// Re-tuned to the curve's L5 interpolation.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 145.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    delay: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.45,
    max_range: 37.0,
    radius: 6.0,
    min_falloff: 0.4,
    damage: 62,
    poise: 10,
    knockback: (strength: 0.0, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    reagent: None,
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Enchantment),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 5 spell -> min_level 30, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(30)),
    ),
)
